# Settings for the local Workers edition (`npm start`).
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` in the same folder and change the value.

# Needed once, to create the administrator at /admin. 16 characters or more.
ADMIN_SETUP_CODE=choose-a-private-phrase

# Optional: Google sign-in.
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=

# Optional: email for password reset codes and notification copies (see AUTH_SETUP.md).
# With both set, connect the Gmail account at /admin > Settings > Email.
# GMAIL_CLIENT_ID=
# GMAIL_CLIENT_SECRET=
